{
  "module": "kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "31b3fb10860508b2ad200dfeda0b2820",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2000",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2000",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "097c0303c24fec0ee64a912ba2d0f7d4f68e7c9ea505a21a5028e16db1b420c5",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "大舞台、始動！",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "57e738e3b96e383a6f894bf570ec7a5b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2000",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2000",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "98ff97ce65037202fed7e6f0beb68b46aaacd728d63cc6252c15b8dcd4f145c2",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "今週の最終勤務日、一人の大人びた%UMA%がトレセン学園に姿を見せた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e24eba70fb9e4fd4701785e050710710",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2000",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2000",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "11ca43798d4119fad2a4a6d11a8d5d82bd23b0fd5f33434c14b9257e8cc6fa47",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "%SEX%の名は %CHARA_ACTUAL%。大舞台と呼ばれる運動の推進者だという。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8befb2c110b07db8c80468c9bdb577b3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2000",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2000",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "c9096c19abc250e62ee89779c7dea378a56991f2cc73b9c50a50ba092803e6e7",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "大舞台運動の目指すところは、より多くの選手が勝者ステージに立てるようにすること。%UMA%たちに、自ら輝く機会を増やすことだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ada75c689ade1b43de8163e6fce77509",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2000",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2000",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "f732656196afad5797410b641fbbadc378a47dd1a1e37609e0790ee95fa1bf77",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "いま大舞台運動は一区切りの成果を収め、URAはG3以下の五レースで大舞台の開催を認めた。対象は毎年入れ替わる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "442ccf28851f19b6881db3dab9330e8b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2000",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2000",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "c846edbef21b833c9bc24b02b66a8ffea07c3a86478c7d5d089035ae71024e79",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "説明を終えると、%CHARA% は %YOU% に、大舞台への支援を頼んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "44d7c3ee4e2546b854b6199a932336c1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2001",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2001",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "f5412492f3ba09d6d04395534995e125f1bdf5513ddc380f167c04cb052a4f82",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "大舞台の夢",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c9c2a846d1dd6f22307e81875ea0c84b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2001",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2001",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "550dadb0c4af559478667084c29253309432f2696bb2e5470c02a02ae87209b8",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は嬉しそうに告げた。一年の試験運用を経て大舞台は大好評で、URAは毎年新たにG2を五レース、大舞台の対象に加えることにした。こちらも年ごとに入れ替わる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4c7c368ef5b5fdbfd113956b243d0c3e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2001",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2001",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4c86d4b1314319878027a36404860185e35474d3aaea5a47bbd8b253b3377e91",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "大舞台を頂点のレースへ——%CHARA% はやる気に満ちていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9bbb2911386f053b008fffc412754711",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "f0df7f50fcc79136ee409e7613052ea5b1030043f56c3c648ffe861597c8d4af",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "夢の開拓者",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "07ccfc29f1e5b6e7156af3b0fe15d2c6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "57fcebf93fa5ce4a4457a05a18240131bb58e5afb1419b4c5cf137e63e2a6918",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は、掲示板の前にぽかんと立ち尽くしていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "249c80b548e8b16f18d9ec6da7aced08",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "86906ed092f90928f3951c1d38b7ea7ce42bc58defe44b16932e6a5730113161",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "来年の大舞台対象レースを知らせる掲示板に、いまはG1が五レース、新たに並んでいる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e6ec8b22217a47b3f1307b72302d21c9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "df43dd797f4d8714c435a22b382b899eae8b8fd84c224bb2efd072ce6e1a3aa5",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "かつてレースでは力及ばなかった%UMA%が、ようやく自分の「勝利」を手にした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "65b5933939a52f71cba74387fb57956b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "8a82b4f6c84dcd81d42f34ee7ae933aa5ac8811ce867512cee78bb2f91a60ece",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "大舞台運動の推進者として、%CHARA% の「勝利」に並ぶものはない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c853ce043380cfb4bd304c109fddbce4",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        4,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "28f7a8b27d8b20a519535d2bf7ed0373638c97605591e2be67e3673e272fc1ef",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "%YOU% は%SEX%をそっと抱き寄せた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "61b82d7ff1627ae457c60876ea5de86c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        4,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "cc1182edcff0e04c1adc155bb0ba08de33dff454730c27c4a7d253b1b7f86bbd",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は %YOU% の肩に寄りかかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b933ab95e92458ee6f0936cdda2e03d4",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        4,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "357822661a455d042933ccbc525459c9e8038b722848aa9677b73a0f9a4363d4",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "言葉は少なく、二人はただ静かに、この「勝利」を噛みしめていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "955466ffb533a17615d4bf0ff06cf4f2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report2002",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report2002",
        "lines",
        5,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "3883b309119ab9440dcd339e0bc9fafc0b90c40b177d06fbc79fb788a4b74960",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "%YOU% は %CHARA% と肩を並べて立ち、無言のまま%SEX%に寄り添った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ce5d3cb53cc49153ccc96f68725c724f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "e4109add8bb4f429fe477de5e4efd84e3207c9aaf47175b6ac826fa8176fab79",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "大舞台",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e9a3c8bb55e0450c51953ca0f1e3ee90",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900800-Light-Hello/edu-308.kojo",
      "key": "report",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "report",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "7c617a916786578cfd4db3c3762f1c637956ae5f1f546fce6099904851526d57",
      "sourceFileHash": "c9525ccbeb917ce4fa6c5b78ade4202dee0dd2c49cb784ead6d53035e3eaeef0",
      "originalText": "また、大舞台の対象レースが発表されるときが来た。",
      "koreanText": ""
    }
  ]
}
